meta {
  name: Access Control Tests
  type: folder
}

docs {
  # Access Control Tests

  This folder contains test requests to verify access control for template resources.

  ## Test Scenarios:

  ### Templates
  - Owner can view their private template
  - Non-owner cannot view private template
  - Admin can view any template
  - Non-owner can view public approved template
  - List templates filters correctly by user

  ### Template Versions
  - Owner can view versions of their private template
  - Non-owner cannot view versions of private template
  - Admin can view versions of any template

  ### Template Version Files
  - Owner can view files of their private template
  - Non-owner cannot view files of private template
  - Admin can view files of any template

  ## Setup:
  1. Create two users (owner and other)
  2. Create a private template owned by owner
  3. Create a public approved template
  4. Create versions and files for testing

  ## Expected Results:
  - 200 OK for authorized access
  - 403 Forbidden for unauthorized access
  - Proper filtering in list endpoints
}
